WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:55.790
Wow, what a great house!

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:01.430
You're my hero.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.670
Oh, now... you're embarrassing me.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.180
Sakurako, I'm home!

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.330
Our tenant's back.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.450
Tenant?

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:41.130
"Sakurako's Secret"

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.710
<i>Why? Why is he here?</i>

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.210
Tsukushi, wasn't it?

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:59.950
Oh, Thomas, do you know Makino?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.060
Makino, have you met him?

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.530
Met him? Of course not.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.770
We met at the club last night.
After that...

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.040
M-Makino...

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:22.370
Sakurako, could you make me
some tea, too?

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.540
Sure. I'll be right back.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.430
Tsukushi... I'm happy
to see you again.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.400
<i>I'm not!</i>

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:47.400
I'm sorry for leaving you alone
at the hotel this morning.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:49.910
Ah... um...

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:02.310
You were so wild and wonderful
last night.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.710
I couldn't believe
it was your first time.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.230
<i>So I really did it...</i>

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.000
<i>With this foreigner?</i>

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.570
Please! Forget about it all!

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.110
Forget it?

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:31.920
Please. I'm begging you
not to tell anyone.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.410
How could I forget?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.180
After what we did together...

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.790
Please! I'll do anything.
Just don't tell anyone.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.510
Anything?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.720
Yes. Anything.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:47.930
Really?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.310
Yes. Really.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.650
Will you see me again?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:51.700
Yes. I will.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.830
Then I won't tell a soul.

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:59.180
<i>I think I've fallen into a trap.</i>

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.140
That's a promise.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.710
Here's your tea, Thomas.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.290
Sorry, Sakurako.
I'll skip tea after all.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.150
<i>What'll I do?</i>

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:27.860
Makino... you look a little pale.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.160
Are you all right?

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:32.770
I'm fine!

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.240
Makino...

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.370
Yes?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.920
Please cure me of my boy phobia.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.060
I'm terrified of boys.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:52.390
The only boy I can talk to
is my childhood friend Thomas.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:57.200
At this rate,
I might never find a husband.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:02.440
You're the only person
I can confide in.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:06.940
I can't trust any of my classmates.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.770
Please...

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.180
But...

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.840
You're my hero.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.920
Just being with you makes me feel strong.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.780
Sakurako...

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:25.980
Please!

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.940
<i>Oh, well... what can I do?</i>

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.160
I'll do what I can.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:45.720
Really? There's a girl
this pretty at our school?

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.070
Makino!

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:50.680
Was that a scream?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.610
What a reaction.
It's getting me hot!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.980
Back off, Nishikado. Down boy.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.990
What a waste that someone
that cute hates boys.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:08.330
I don't h-hate boys.
I-I'm afraid of them.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:13.800
So why did such a pretty thing
become so scared of boys?

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:19.840
I'm not p-pretty.
I'm ugly and fat...

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:24.110
If you're ugly,
what does that make Makino?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.340
Isn't that right, Tsukasa?

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.350
Makino's... cute.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.020
What?

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.300
<i>What is he saying?!</i>

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:39.860
Are you serious?

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:44.960
Anyone who's not your sister
is a cat or a dog to you.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.110
Shut up, you moron!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.990
Whataya mean, a cat or dog?
Take it back!

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.220
Here we go again...

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.170
<i>That was a shock!</i>

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:02.290
Domyoji likes you, doesn't he?

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.350
Of course not.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.260
Sakurako...

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:19.910
I'm jealous. You two are made
for each other.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.650
<i>Am I seeing things?
Her eyes looked so cold for a second there...</i>

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.900
Hang on, Tsuki.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:36.910
Who's that girl getting cozy
with the F4?

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.950
You mean Sakurako?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.980
We saw her in Roppongi
the other night.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.060
She was all tarted up, too.

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:52.180
Yeah. And she acts so innocent
in school.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:56.400
Sakurako? You must be confused.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.630
No, it was her all right.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:02.800
She's probably using you
to snag one of the F4.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.790
<i>You're the ones trying to snag them!</i>

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:09.850
Be careful.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:13.250
You never know what's hiding
behind that pretty face.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.300
She's not like that!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.040
Wait a minute!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.310
Tsuki!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.190
I've had it!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:28.590
They're freaking out just because
she's hanging with the F4.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:29.830
But...

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:36.320
She's changed a lot
since elementary school.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.820
You knew Sakurako, Makiko?

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:43.440
I've only got vague memories, but...

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:47.650
I think she was more cheerful 
and energetic as a child.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:53.220
Cheerful and energetic... Sakurako?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.320
<i>We saw her in Roppongi
the other night.</i>

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:02.850
<i>She was all tarted up, too.</i>

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.830
Makino!

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.470
What's wrong, Sakurako?

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.940
Nishikado said something horrible.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.210
Horrible?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.800
I just said it was rare for a 16-year-old

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:25.880
to have no experience with boys.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.250
How could I...?

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:33.280
<i>"Experience with boys"...
I just remembered!</i>

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.630
She's so innocent. 
Pretty rare nowadays.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.560
Makino!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.470
<i>She's so cute.</i>

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:48.710
<i>I can't imagine her
getting "tarted up."</i>

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:54.070
Makino! We're gonna hang out.
Want to come?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.710
Sakurako's coming too, right?

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.840
Of course. I can't let her
go alone.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:08.690
I forgot, Makino.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.360
I was asked to give this to you.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.220
Thomas

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.740
<i>From T-Thomas?</i>

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.930
What's up? Let's go.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:29.010
I-I... I just remembered
I have to do something.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.580
Go on without me.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.350
I'm sorry, Sakurako.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.810
<i>I'll be waiting at Galbo,
in front of the station.</i>

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.720
<i>That foreigner, Thomas...</i>

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:17.390
<i>In some ways, he's more dangerous
than Domyoji.</i>

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.570
<i>It happened once...</i>

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.660
<i>What if he tries to seduce me again?</i>

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.200
<i>What should I do?
Maybe I shouldn't go...</i>

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:30.170
<i>But I promised to see him again...</i>

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.870
<i>But it might be dangerous
seeing him again...</i>

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:38.580
<i>But I've got to see him
to keep him quiet.</i>

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.850
<i>I've got to calm down.</i>

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.460
I'm so nervous!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.130
<i>It's no use...</i>

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.940
Tsukushi?

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.340
What are you doing here?

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.850
Tsukushi... you're late.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.480
You're right. He is a foreigner.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.060
I brought a friend.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:38.060
Wow! He really has blue eyes!
I've never seen them up close.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.400
Should I say something to him?

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.040
Uh... <i>"how do you do?"</i>

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.190
Kazuya, he's German.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.550
Oh? What's the German language?

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.780
Uh... <i>"What language is German"?</i>

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.450
<i>Ack... was this a bad idea?</i>

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.460
<i>Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.340
<i>He does look a little like him.</i>

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:26.640
<i>My heart still aches.
Does that mean I really loved him?</i>

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:30.790
Thanks.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.910
Tsukushi... this guy's something else!

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.270
<i>Whoa! That's some belch!</i>

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.880
<i>My image of him...</i>

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:05.720
What is it?

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:07.990
<i>I should say something.</i>

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:11.660
Why do you speak
Japanese so well?

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.230
It's because I'm bi-racial.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.730
My father's Japanese
and my mother's German.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:19.030
Sakurako and I went to
the same Japanese school in Germany.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.530
You're half-Japanese?

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:28.090
H-he just farted, Tsukushi!

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.540
He <i>farted!</i>

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.180
Well, it's not healthy
to hold it in.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.050
<i>What's this guy's deal?</i>

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.390
<i>I can't believe he's 
friends with that polite Sakurako.</i>

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:45.890
Thomas, are you a student?
Or do you work?

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:47.430
Work?

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:52.360
Why work when Sakurako
gives me money...

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.300
She does?

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:58.940
No... I mean her family
takes care of me.

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.640
Is that the time, already?
I've got to go.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:04.640
See you later, Tsukushi.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.380
Next time, leave the kid behind.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.880
What kid?

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.880
Are you talking about me?

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.320
<i>Something's weird.</i>

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:19.290
<i>I can't see the connection
between Thomas and Sakurako.</i>

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:26.360
<i>To think that I... with that slob...</i>

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:30.000
<i>No, no, no! I want to die!</i>

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.920
<i>Leave it to those two veteran playboys...</i>

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:56.430
Makino!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:01.930
That's great! You look pretty comfortable
talking with them.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:03.700
It's true.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.440
The F4 are all so much fun!

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:11.480
I'm afraid of bees!

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.880
Help me, Domyoji!

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.650
I hate bugs!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:22.950
Hey, back up! It's just a bug.
Quit screaming!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:30.060
Thank you.

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:34.130
<i>Idiot! What am I getting jealous for?</i>

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:51.550
What's the matter, Tsukushi?

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:55.120
You appear out of nowhere,
looking all gloomy.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.390
So much has happened lately...

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:05.760
What you need is
a night of clubbing!

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:08.400
Come on! Get ready! Get ready!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.250
This place is jumping tonight!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.420
This is too much!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:33.190
I can't take it.
This is overwhelming.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.760
What's the ruckus?

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.330
This really popular model-quality girl's
made her entrance.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:46.200
The one everyone's buzzing about?

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.700
Where is she?

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.210
Over there.
She's dancing in the middle.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.060
<i>Sakurako?!</i>

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:18.200
<i>I can't believe it!
I can't believe it!</i>

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.030
<i>I can't believe it!</i>

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:24.940
Here you go.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.150
What's your name?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.450
You're cute.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.190
Hey, you there.

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:49.970
We need to talk.

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:05.410
You got your claws
into DJ Hatta, right?

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.180
He was Miho's boyfriend.

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.680
Do you think you can
just get away with it?

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.090
Say something! Come on...

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:17.970
S-stop...

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.490
What fat legs.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.400
And all that make-up
just to look passable.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:38.270
I'm shocked you're not embarrassed
to be seen like this.

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.310
So what if I stole your boyfriend?

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.120
It's your fault for being so ugly!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:49.090
How dare you!
What do you mean, ugly?!

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:52.040
Ugly, ugly, ugly dog!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.710
Don't be bitter because
you can't hold onto a guy...

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.430
without heavy makeup and cheap outfits.

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:04.770
If he meant that much to you,
why didn't you keep him leashed?

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:09.850
Guys like him are just strays
on the roadside to me.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:18.060
If you think you can compete with me,
with your looks...

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:21.920
You're delusional.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.560
Miho...

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:44.610
<i>Is that really sweet,
polite Sakurako?</i>

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:11.560
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:19.440
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:29.320
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:37.360
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:45.130
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:53.270
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:53.270
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:01.650
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:01.650
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:11.420
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:19.200
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:27.370
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:27.370
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:35.780
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:35.780
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:48.560 --> 00:23:52.030
Everyone knows about
what happened with Thomas.

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:54.860
Our photo was posted on
the bulletin board.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:58.170
I'll never forgive you,
Thomas! How could you?

00:23:59.070 --> 00:24:01.200
What's wrong, Makino?

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.870
And Sakurako turns,
smiling coldly at me.

00:24:05.370 --> 00:24:08.380
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Get Lost!!"
